  "name": "Check VTY",
  "description": "Check if line vty 0 4 is secured",
  "folder": "Gallery",
  "visibility": "private",
  "notes": "# This workflow checks if the VTY line is secured:\n\nThis config is valid and **passes** the test:\n\n```\nip access-list extended MGMT_in\n 10 permit tcp w.x.y.z any eq 22\n\nline vty 0 4\n access-class MGMT_in in\n exec-timeout 0 0\n transport input ssh\n```\n\nIt does the following:\n1. Check if we find the string \"access-class\"\n2. Get the name of the access class\n3. Check if the access class exists in the config",
